gh the roots of plants.\n* **High Heat Capacity:** Water can absorb a lot of heat before its temperature changes significantly. This helps regulate the climate of the entire planet and keeps our body temperatures stable.\n* **Cohesion and Adhesion:** Water molecules love to stick to"
